body:
FEAT: Dash + Multi Workers Support

Dash:

- run_dashboard.py introduction.
- fix "get" queries to obtain proper names and not ids for display;
- improve SQL storing;
- Leverage all data endpoints to provide accurate and cool visuals:
-- Live / Historical for each Type of data;
-- TTH + SQL modes.

Multi Workers Support:

- global states with leader elections in order to have multi workers in uvicorn;
- redis semaphore for multi workers;
- logging support to state each worker PID;
- robustness of Redis / SQL connection pools and error handling;
- Minor Dash fixes for race condition and paginations.
